    "en": {
      "title": "Crawlers",
      "h1": "Crawler rigs",
      "description": "Tracked drilling rigs from Marini are versatile and powerful machines designed for drilling in challenging terrain. These rigs are used for foundation work…",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "Marini logo",
          "href": "/productos/marini",
          "width": 928,
          "height": 542,
          "src": "/assets/img/logo-marini-emblem.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "Crawler rigs: image 2",
          "width": 1245,
          "height": 857,
          "src": "/assets/img/marini-crawlers-2.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Tracked drilling rigs from Marini are versatile and powerful machines designed for drilling in challenging terrain. These rigs are used for foundation work, slope stabilisation, micropiling and anchoring. Their tracks give excellent mobility on uneven ground and make them ideal for both small and large projects."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "With the MR-C line, Marini offers hydraulic drilling rigs for drilling with drifters and rotary heads and with the possibility of jet grouting."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<a href=\"/contacto\">Contact us</a> for more information."
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "kind": "download",
          "text": "Short brochure (ENG)",
          "href": "/assets/docs/marini-crawlers-kort-broschyr-eng.pdf",
          "driveId": "1ieWNcqMvkkbHi3IYedIFbdB5CFFLiKLR"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "kind": "download",
          "text": "Product catalogue",
          "href": "/assets/docs/marini-crawlers-produktkatalog.pdf",
          "driveId": "1ecMiKcn9MMZ4A09FXVKtBN1SAgcdwbvd"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Models such as MR-C 10 and MR-C 15 are compact and powerful enough for smaller projects, while MR-C 90 and MR-C 95 are designed for larger and deeper boreholes, with higher capacity and force. MR-C 30 is the optimal model specially adapted for indoor use."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Rigs marked with A after the model number (e.g. MR-C 85A Line) stand for Attachment (or detachable mast), which means the mast can be dismantled for increased flexibility and ease of transport."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Rigs marked with P (e.g. MR-C 95P) stand for Power (or Performance, often in reference to extra powerful models). These rigs usually have higher engine power and are designed to handle heavier drilling work and deeper boreholes."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "The technical specifications of the rigs are summarised in the table below."
        },
